---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Copyright Information | Study Hub"
  description="Draft copyright information for Study Hub and third-party learning materials."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Draft for review</p>
      <h1>Copyright Information</h1>
      <p>This draft explains how Study Hub distinguishes its own work from resources provided by other authors and publishers.</p>
    </header>
    <article class="legal-copy">
      <section>
        <h2>Study Hub materials</h2>
        <p>Unless a page says otherwise, the Study Hub name, site design, original descriptions, and original written content are protected by their respective rights holders. Contact Study Hub before reusing original site content beyond what applicable law permits.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Third-party resources</h2>
        <p>Study notes, examination papers, guides, images, and other contributed resources may belong to their authors, schools, publishers, or other rights holders. Their appearance on Study Hub does not transfer ownership or grant permission to redistribute them.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Permission and concerns</h2>
        <p>Check the rights and permissions that apply to a resource before copying, adapting, or sharing it. If you believe material on Study Hub has been included in error, contact <a href="mailto:trusteth777@gmail.com">Study Hub</a> with the relevant page or resource details.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>